network:T1 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual
  , network:Line
  ; rdfs:comment "Lines. T1 runs Gare Centrale – Technopôle through the university, T2 Port Fluvial – Plaine des Sports (the north–south spine), T3 Musée des Tisserands – Cimetière Est, bus 10 Gare Centrale up the hill to Vergers, bus 11 Université – Moulin Neuf (the outer ring). Interchanges, stops on two lines or more: GAR (T1, T2, B10), HDV (T2, T3, B11), REP (T1, T3) and UNI (T1, B11)."
